 "description": "A pedestrian crossing: its controller a state diagram (traffic), its lamps a truth table (lamps), its timer drawn here.\nThe timer: a 2-bit counter of the seconds (tick) cleared at its 4th or by reset; each phase lasts 4 seconds; t(0) blinks the lamps that blink.\nreq: a pedestrian is waiting; night: the night mode (the cars' yellow blinking); tick: a second (a pulse of one clock cycle).",
